e an arbitrary rule sentence merely because ActType bytes match. W6 must demonstrate loss/concurrency/restart recovery without fresh signing. These remain verification of the complete approved scope, not scope exceptions.\n\nWire: The planned2025 initialization/session interface and2026 per-request metadata/discovery/subscription/resultType interface are separated; pinned real-client W7 must prove both transports and exact served revisions. Root rechecked official revision sources in this review chain. Tool-name guidance recommends ASCII letters/digits/underscore/hyphen/dot and1–128 characters; choose or validate the variant separator/length with the actual supported hosts and SDK rather than treating @ as guaranteed universally compatible. This is a nonblocking implementation compatibility detail, not a claimed SDK rejection. Sources: https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/blob/main/docs/specification/2026-07-28/server/tools.mdx ; https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/blob/main/docs/specification/2026-07-28/changelog.mdx ; https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/transports .\n\nCoverage: Primary new opening/body read first. Two peers FULL-read all fresh8341BODY bytes and U326404B, inheriting81204 unchanged bytes only after exact native comparison to fully coveredfc23. Root FULL-read both final analyses/audits and independently verified both reconstruction ledgers cover entire89545B1036LF BODY through EOF: SHAd95a942a84548110e8fe3328fbd690284b79afe425ad0c2bced4d5f22fc97a30; U3 SHAd279e91f4eae51cfa11c3270486349ebd8eafba793a8c58bac2aeb7a429bb826. Root FULL-read indexU31453B SHA78e78387819f4f66640b2baabecd764044c1ff176b8a001f9e37d2e59a8472c0. Corrected native2241B glossary coverage and earlier bounded native prepare/derive/core/type units inherit verified unchanged identities. Unchanged whole index and partial support modules are not newly claimed FULL-read. No Source/tests/build/gate/browser/provider/